[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":53},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":51,"_13":51,"_38":52},"id","basico-cantos","nome","Corners in place","rascunho",false,"html","<p>The top face is yellow, but the corners may be swapped among themselves. Now each corner goes to its place, looking at the side colors. The top edges may move: they are for the last step.</p>\n<h2>Look for the headlights</h2>\n<p>Look at the sides of the top layer. When the two corners on one side have the same color, like the two headlights of a car, those two corners are right relative to each other.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F R U' R' U R U R2 F' R U R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/e038fe8d2cfeba6d.svg\" alt=\"Red headlights on the left.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Red headlights on the left.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>The algorithm</h2>\n<p class=\"formula\"><code>R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'</code></p>\n<p>It swaps the two right corners (and two edges, which don&#39;t matter now). Break it into three parts to memorize: the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a> <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>, then <code>R&#39; F R2 U&#39; R&#39;</code>, and finally <code>U&#39; R U R&#39; F&#39;</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>With headlights</strong>: turn the top (<code>U</code>) until the headlights are on the left. Do the algorithm.</p>\n<p><strong>No headlights</strong> (no side with two matching corners): do the algorithm from any side. The headlights show up, and you do it again with them on the left.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/be9db3789a1f5dc0.svg\" alt=\"Before: headlights on the left. Click to see the algorithm.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Before: headlights on the left. Click to see the algorithm.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/0f18a2cfa65c98f7.svg\" alt=\"After: the right corners swapped, and all 4 corners right.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>After: the right corners swapped, and all 4 corners right.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F' U&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U' R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/249a1db50e82c8d1.svg\" alt=\"Headlights at the back: `U'` takes the headlights to the left, and the algorithm.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Headlights at the back: <code>U&#39;</code> takes the headlights to the left, and the algorithm.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F R U' R' U' R U R' F' R U R' U' R' F R F'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F' U2 R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F' U&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/eebb220a69e87add.svg\" alt=\"No headlights: the algorithm makes the headlights show up; `U2` takes them to the left, the algorithm again, and `U` lines up the top.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>No headlights: the algorithm makes the headlights show up; <code>U2</code> takes them to the left, the algorithm again, and <code>U</code> lines up the top.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Line up the top</h2>\n<p>At the end, all 4 corners are right relative to each other. Turn the top (<code>U</code>) until each corner is above the centers of its colors.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;U&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;cp&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/c179ece00e72f460.svg\" alt=\"Corners right relative to each other, but the top is turned: `U'` lines it up.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Corners right relative to each other, but the top is turned: <code>U&#39;</code> lines it up.</figcaption></figure></div>\n","treino","/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/cantos/casos","metodos",[46],"anterior",{"_13":44,"_38":45},"proximo",{"_13":42,"_38":43},"grupos",[29],{"_11":30,"_13":14,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":16,"_36":37,"_38":39},"Passo 6","nivel","iniciante","casos",2,"conjunto","ids",[40,41],"endereco","/3x3/basico/cantos/casos","B6-Dois-cantos-certos","B6-Nenhum-par-certo","Edges in place","/3x3/basico/arestas","Yellow face","/3x3/basico/face-amarela",{"_13":47,"_48":49,"_38":50},"Beginner method","numero",8,"/3x3/basico#cantos","3x3","/3x3/",{"_54":55,"_56":57},"cubos",[60,61,62,63,64,65],"idiomas",[58,59],"pt","en",{"_11":51,"_13":51},{"_11":72,"_13":72},{"_11":71,"_13":71},{"_11":70,"_13":70},{"_11":68,"_13":69},{"_11":66,"_13":67},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2"]
